            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "How can I track my order?",
            "content": "<p>You can track your order by checking the shipping confirmation email, which contains a tracking number and a link to the courier's website. Alternatively, log in to your account on our website, navigate to \"My Orders,\" and click on the tracking link provided for your order.</p>",
